    "UIName": "Mad Cat LAM 'Timber Wolf'",
    "Id": "mechdef_mad_cat_lam_MCLAM-TW",
    "Name": "Timber Wolf",
    "Details": "Boss, this is mostly a Timber Wolf but some goomba has crammed parts of two different LAM conversion systems in there, looks like a Champion and a Phoenix Hawk. It really shouldn't work, like ever... but looks like it will. It'll fly like a brick though, so don't expect it to perform anything as well as either of it's half-parents.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "Timberwolf"
  },
